    LLM: 'Game: 30 Point Black Tile. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '30 Point Black Tile is a Hearts-style domino game using a double-six set: 30 penalty points per deal. Three or four players pass three tiles left; leader nominates suit each trick. Lowest total score wins. Same family as 11 Point and 21 Point Black Tile.',
    objective: 'Avoid taking tricks containing penalty tiles; 30 points in penalties per deal. Lowest total score wins.',
    gameplay: 'Leader plays a tile and nominates suit (0-6 or doubles). Others follow suit if possible; highest in led suit wins trick. Same as 11 and 21 Point Black Tile but 30 penalty points.',
